    DisplayName: Cursed Blood
    Description: 'Unlocks Cursed Blood: 50 Fury, once per fight. For 2 turns nothing
      heals him; every heal that would land, his regen and Unbroken''s included,
      is thrown at every enemy as Void damage instead, as much as he was missing.
      Free, gated at 20 embers spent in this path.'
